A trap door is a wooden spot in the floor, that has a deep hole below
it.  A squeaky board is a wooden spot in the floor, that doesn't
necessarily have a deep hole below it.

In any event, we should probably assume that these traps initially
have the appearance of a rock floor, so that it's believable that our
characters sometimes unknowingly step on them.  For example, a trap
door might be mostly wooden, but its top layer is covered in a thin
sheet of rocks, so that it looks like a dungeon floor.


